# Template for ~/.config/reviewd/secrets.env
# After filling in real values:
#   chmod 600 ~/.config/reviewd/secrets.env
# This file is read by run.sh and exported into reviewd's environment.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anthropic auth — pick ONE of the two below, comment out the other.
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN takes precedence if both are set.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

# OPTION A: Long-lived OAuth token from a Claude Code subscription.
# Generate with: claude setup-token  (browser flow, requires the account
# whose subscription you want to bill against — typically the Team plan
# for org-funded usage). Token lasts 1 year. No marginal API charges —
# usage counts against the subscription pool.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=sk-ant-oat...

# OPTION B: Anthropic API key — pay-per-use, billed to a workspace.
# Generate at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys with a monthly
# spend cap set in the console. Use this when you want hard cost limits
# or attribution separated from any subscription.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# BitBucket workspace access token (Bearer auth — recommended).
# Create at: BitBucket -> Workspace settings -> Security -> Access tokens
# Permissions: Pull requests Read + Write
# Referenced from ~/.config/reviewd/config.yaml as ${BB_WORKSPACE_TOKEN}
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
BB_WORKSPACE_TOKEN=ATCTT3x...

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub token (only if watching GitHub repos).
# Fine-grained PAT or classic token with Pull requests Read + Write.
# Referenced from ~/.config/reviewd/config.yaml as ${GITHUB_TOKEN}
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# GITHUB_TOKEN=github_pat_...

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub Copilot CLI token (only for repos using `engine: pipeline`).
# Fine-grained PAT owned by a personal account (not an organization) that
# has a Copilot seat, with the Account permission "Copilot Requests" and
# repository access "Public repositories". Classic ghp_ tokens don't work.
# Create at: https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
# reviewd removes GH_TOKEN/GITHUB_TOKEN from Copilot's environment, so this
# is the only credential Copilot sees. Note its expiry.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN=github_pat_...
